.York, who is originally from Youngstown, Ohio, was arrested Sunday morning at the Wheat Hill Mobile Home Community in East Palestine,according to local news station WKBN. The arrest was reportedly conducted by the Mahoning Valley Human Trafficking Task Force as well as East Palestine police. By Monday morning, York had pleaded no contest to misdemeanor charges of disorderly conduct and possessing criminal tools.According to Columbiana Court records, York was fined a total of $1,150 and sentenced to two days in Columbiana County Jail, concurrently, and received credit for one day already served. The 49ers owner had already filed a request to expunge the case from his record.", "published_at": "2026-08-24 19:22:46+00", "image_url": "https://lede-admin.defector.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/28/2026/08/GettyImages-2249590394-e1787598946291.jpg", "source": {"name": "Defector", "tier": "independent", "url": "https://defector.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 20, "sensationalism": 9, "opinion_fact": 10, "factual_rigor": 49, "framing": 23, "confidence": 0.66, "rationale": "\"{\\\"lean\\\": {\\\"keyword_score\\\": 50.0, \\\"framing_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"entity_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"sentence_direction\\\": 0.0, \\\"text_score\\\": 50.0, \\\"source_baseline\\\": 20, \\\"text_shift\\\": 0.0, \\\"delta_max\\\": 10, \\\"confidence\\\": 1.0, \\\"top_left_keywords\\\": [], \\\"top_right_keywords\\\": [], \\\"framing_phrases_found\\\": [], \\\"entity_sentiments\\\": {}, \\\"state_affiliated\\\": false, \\\"unscored\\\": false}, \\\"sensationalism\\\": {\\\"headline_score\\\": 0.5, \\\"body_score\\\": 7.3, \\\"clickbait_signals\\\": 0, \\\"superlative_density\\\": 0.19, \\\"urgency_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"hyperbole_density\\\": 0.0, \\\"measured_density\\\": 0.58, \\\"partisan_attack_density\\\": 0.0}, \\\"opinion\\\": {\\\"pronoun_score\\\": 9.6, \\\"subjectivity_score\\\": 29.9, \\\"modal_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"hedging_score\\\": 0.0, \\\"attribution_score\\\": 21.3, \\\"metadata_sc